  "Price SGU, DGU, laminated and combined build-ups against real sheet costs, then turn the quotation into a job order without retyping it.": "Harga SGU, DGU, laminasi dan gabungan build-up terhadap biaya lembaran sebenarnya, lalu ubah kutipan menjadi PERINTAH KERJA tanpa mengetik ulang.",
